  "description": "This project requires the [Datasets about Dataiku Instance Plugin](https://github.com/THE-MOLECULAR-MAN/dss-plugin-xzibit/releases/) .\n\nThis data processing flow is designed to manage and transform datasets related to both internal statistics and plugin datasets within a Dataiku DSS (Data Science Studio) environment. \n\nIn the **Internal Stat datasets** zone, the flow processes DSS\u0027s internal logs from: Scenario Runs, Cluster Tasks, Jobs, and Commits. This flow zone uses native DSS features and does not require an additional plugin. This results in a comprehensive view of project activities, facilitating better analysis of scenario executions, task performance, job stability, and software development changes. \n\nThe other flow zones pull data using the [Datasets about Dataiku Instance Plugin](https://github.com/THE-MOLECULAR-MAN/dss-plugin-xzibit/releases/) and builds datasets and dashboards useful for:\n* tracking\n\n",
  "shortDesc": "This project has not been certified for use in production instances. Do not use this project on production or mission critical DSS nodes.\n\nThis project assists with administering DSS and planning DSS upgrades.",
